[Term]
id: ECAO:1000036
name: early gastrula stage
namespace: echinoderm_developmental_stage
def: "Stage at which the archenteron (primitive digestive tract) has elongated up to 1/3 of its final length. This elongation has occurred through the inward movement of all non-skeletogenic mesoderm (NSM) cells and part of the endoderm." []
synonym: "EG" RELATED []
