def: "A heterogeneous subclass of blastocoelar cells; 5–7 μm in diameter, and with 2 to 5 filopodial projections that extend 10–50 μm. Filopodial cells are located in the blastocoel and across the basal surface of ectoderm and gut epithelia, and form multiple interconnected, syncytial networks." []
